\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Comprehensive benchmark results across 10,000 recorded trials: \textbf  {(a)}\nobreakspace  {}end-to-end motion-to-photon latency histogram on 60\,Hz display ($44.35\pm 4.36$\,ms, 95\% CI [44.26, 44.43]\,ms); \textbf  {(b)}\nobreakspace  {}quiescent 60-s cursor drift trajectories, showing erratic wandering with deadzone off ($25.44\pm 4.16$\,px) vs. zero drift with deadzone on ($0.00\pm 0.00$\,px); \textbf  {(c)}\nobreakspace  {}dwell selection timing error across 0.5--5.0\,s thresholds ($+2.41\pm 4.13$\,ms); \textbf  {(d)}\nobreakspace  {}speech synthesis onset latency for cloud vs. offline engines in English and Bengali; \textbf  {(e)}\nobreakspace  {}BLE HID reporting intervals ($20.54\pm 1.43$\,ms); and \textbf  {(f)}\nobreakspace  {}continuous battery discharge profile from 4.20\,V down to 3.30\,V cutoff.}}{13}{}\protected@file@percent }
